WEBVTT

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.378
or they're whispering gently.

00:05:31.246 --> 00:05:34.733
They may even be pretending
to be a hairdresser

00:05:34.733 --> 00:05:37.452
or pretending to be
a health care professional

00:05:37.452 --> 00:05:40.822
or just speaking softly
the way a close friend would to you.

00:05:42.424 --> 00:05:45.994
And right now ...

00:05:45.994 --> 00:05:47.929
I’d like to introduce you

00:05:47.929 --> 00:05:50.899
to some very popular
ASMR artists on YouTube.

00:05:51.933 --> 00:05:53.368
So lean back,

00:05:53.368 --> 00:05:54.536
stretch out your legs.

00:05:54.536 --> 00:05:55.537
(Laughter)

00:05:55.537 --> 00:05:56.605
And enjoy.

00:05:58.823 --> 00:05:59.975
(Video) ASMR Glow: Good.